OL,3,AUK's gaps in Arctic defence leave it
OL,4,Aopen to Russian attacks, committee
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the event of a conflict, the report
OL,8,Fadded that Russia could threaten the
OL,9,FUK's population, civilian and military
OL,10,Finfrastructure and vital supply routes
OL,11,Facross the Atlantic from the US.
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) said it
OL,14,Fis "clear-eyed about the threat Russia
OL,15,Fposed" and is investing heavily to
OL,16,Fprotect Britain's undersea cables.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
