OL,3,AHow Arab parties could hold critical
OL,4,Abalance of power in Israeli election
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt rush hour in Nazareth, the largest
OL,7,FArab-majority city in Israel, students
OL,8,Fare handing out leaflets by the
OL,9,Froadside urging motorists to vote in
OL,10,Fnext week's closely fought, general
OL,11,Felection. Polls indicate that Arab
OL,12,Fparties could be left holding a
OL,13,Fcritical balance of power.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
