OL,3,AHow Arab parties could hold critical
OL,4,Abalance of power in Israeli election
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisaffection has often driven down past
OL,7,Fturnout among Arab Israelis - who
OL,8,Faccount for about a fifth of the
OL,9,Fpopulation and often describe
OL,10,Fthemselves as Palestinian citizens of
OL,11,FIsrael. But this election, there is a
OL,12,Fstrong push to get rid of the most
OL,13,Fright-wing governing coalition in the
OL,14,Fcountry's history - an alliance between
OL,15,Fveteran Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,16,FNetanyahu and far-right and
OL,17,Fultra-Orthodox parties.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
