OL,3,ARosenberg: Russia agrees to Ukraine
OL,4,Atalks but sees little to talk about in
OL,5,Anew peace push
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter two days of diplomacy ` in
OL,8,FNorway's capital and Russia's St
OL,9,FPetersburg ` is the war in Ukraine any
OL,10,Fcloser to ending?
OL,12,F"Good and constructive" is how Norway's
OL,13,Fprime minister described Tuesday's
OL,14,Ftalks between Ukrainian President
OL,15,FVolodymyr Zelensky, US President
OL,16,FTrump's special envoy Steve Witkoff and
OL,17,FEuropean representatives.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
